---

The bindings in this repository contain no ClickHouse code. They load, at run
time, a separately distributed native artifact that embeds a build of
ClickHouse (https://github.com/ClickHouse/ClickHouse, Apache License 2.0).
Those artifacts are NOT covered by this repository's license: each artifact
release carries its own LICENSE file and is distributed under the Elastic
License 2.0. See docs/guides/artifacts.md.

tests/fixtures/fetch-v1/test-key/ and tests/fixtures/fetch-v1/other-key/ each
contain an ed25519 key pair, both halves, that signs the v1 fetch conformance
fixtures and nothing else. Both are deliberately not secret; neither is ever
the artifact release key.
